<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Random Number Picker | Free Number Generator</title><meta name="description" content="Generate one or more random numbers from any range, with optional no-repeat results. Free, private and works on phones and computers."><meta name="robots" content="index,follow"><link rel="canonical" href="https://wheelnamepicker.com.au/random-number-picker"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/value-pages.css"></head><body><div class="top"><div class="nav"><a class="brand" href="/">Wheel Name Picker</a><div class="links"><a href="/student-picker">Student Picker</a><a href="/team-picker">Team Picker</a><a href="/dice-roller">Dice Roller</a><a href="/coin-toss">Coin Toss</a></div></div></div><header class="hero"><span class="badge">Free random number tool</span><h1>Random Number Picker</h1><p>Choose a minimum, maximum and how many results you need. Use no-repeat mode for unique numbers, or allow repeats when each draw should be independent.</p></header><main class="wrap"><div class="tool"><div class="grid"><div class="field"><label for="min">Minimum</label><input id="min" type="number" value="1"></div><div class="field"><label for="max">Maximum</label><input id="max" type="number" value="100"></div><div class="field"><label for="count">How many numbers?</label><input id="count" type="number" min="1" value="1"></div><div class="field"><label for="repeat">Duplicates</label><select id="repeat"><option value="no">No repeats</option><option value="yes">Repeats allowed</option></select></div></div><div class="actions"><button id="pick">Pick numbers</button><button class="secondary" id="copy">Copy result</button></div><div class="result" id="result">Your result will appear here.</div></div><div class="article"><section><h2>What this number picker is for</h2><p>This tool is useful whenever you have a numbered list, a range of tickets, a set of classroom questions or a simple decision that can be represented by numbers. You set the boundaries yourself, so it works for small ranges such as 1 to 6 and large ranges such as 1 to 10,000.</p><p>The picker runs in your browser. The values you enter are not sent to a server, and there is no account or sign-in step.</p></section><section><h2>Repeats versus unique results</h2><p>If you choose <strong>no repeats</strong>, every number in the result is unique. That is useful when selecting several different worksheet questions, seat numbers or numbered tasks. If you allow repeats, every draw is independent, so the same number can appear more than once.</p><p class="note">If you ask for more unique numbers than the range contains, the tool will tell you to reduce the count or increase the range.</p></section><section><h2>Examples</h2><ul><li><strong>Classroom:</strong> pick 5 different question numbers from 1 to 30.</li><li><strong>Board games:</strong> generate a number from 1 to 12 without reaching for dice.</li><li><strong>Household jobs:</strong> number a list of tasks and choose one at random.</li><li><strong>Practice sessions:</strong> choose random drill numbers so the same sequence is not repeated every time.</li></ul></section><section><h2>How the result is generated</h2><p>The page uses the browser's built-in JavaScript random function to select values inside the range you provide. It is intended for everyday activities, learning and informal decisions. It is not designed as audited software for regulated drawings, financial systems, security tokens or other situations that require a certified random process.</p></section><section><h2>Related tools</h2><div class="cards"><a class="card" href="/yes-no-picker">Yes or No Picker<span>For simple two-option decisions.</span></a><a class="card" href="/weekday-picker">Weekday Picker<span>Randomly choose from the days you include.</span></a><a class="card" href="/student-picker">Student Picker<span>Pick from a list of names and track selections.</span></a></div></section></div></main><footer class="footer"><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/terms">Terms</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><p>© 2026 Wheel Name Picker · Ascension Digital Group</p></footer><script>const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);function generate(){let a=Number($('min').value),b=Number($('max').value),n=Math.max(1,Math.floor(Number($('count').value)||1));if(!Number.isFinite(a)||!Number.isFinite(b)){return $('result').textContent='Enter a valid minimum and maximum.'}if(a>b)[a,b]=[b,a];a=Math.ceil(a);b=Math.floor(b);const size=b-a+1;if(size<1)return $('result').textContent='The range must contain at least one whole number.';const repeat=$('repeat').value==='yes';if(!repeat&&n>size)return $('result').textContent=`There are only ${size} unique whole numbers in this range.`;const out=[];while(out.length<n){const v=Math.floor(Math.random()*size)+a;if(repeat||!out.includes(v))out.push(v)}$('result').innerHTML='<strong>'+out.join(', ')+'</strong><br><small>Range '+a+' to '+b+(repeat?' · repeats allowed':' · unique results')+'</small>'} $('pick').onclick=generate;$('copy').onclick=()=>navigator.clipboard?.writeText($('result').innerText);</script></body></html>